| riscos-mesa SDL test: a 1024x768 software window the old way (SDL's ordinary framebuffer), to compare.
| Squares move over a grid for 30 seconds; the title shows fps. Results in SDLFBplain.
Dir <Obey$Dir>
| ELF programs need the slot set before they start, whatever the Next slot is
WimpSlot -min 16000K
Run sdlfbtest 1024 768 -t 30 -o SDLFBplain
